# Docker sends only what's listed here, so nothing new in the project (a .env
# with secrets, editor folders, coverage reports, .git) can slip into an image
# by accident. These are exactly what the Dockerfile COPYs; if you add a COPY
# for another file or folder, add a matching "!" line here too.
*
!Gemfile
!Gemfile.lock
!config.ru
!app/
!lib/

# Even inside the folders above, leave out macOS clutter.
**/.DS_Store
